@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@hotelId = 1
@roomId = 1
@quoteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get cached room availability for a hotel stay
GET {{baseUrl}}/Booking/availability?hotelId={{hotelId}}&checkIn=2026-11-10&checkOut=2026-11-13

### Create a quote after the API validates current database inventory
POST {{baseUrl}}/Booking/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "checkIn": "2026-11-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-11-13",
  "roomIds": [{{roomId}}]
}

### Get a quote; replace quoteId with the ID returned by Create a quote
GET {{baseUrl}}/Booking/quote/{{quoteId}}

### Confirm a quote within 30 seconds; replace quoteId with the returned ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/Booking/quote/{{quoteId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Alex Guest",
  "guestPhone": "+1-555-0100",
  "guestEmail": "alex.guest@example.com"
}

### Get persisted request and response traces for a confirmed booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/Booking/1/traces

### Expired or unknown quote error example
POST {{baseUrl}}/Booking/quote/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Alex Guest",
  "guestPhone": "+1-555-0100",
  "guestEmail": "alex.guest@example.com"
}
